OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRemaining windy and showery,
OL,6,Fthe showers heavy with the risk of the
OL,7,Fodd thunderstorm. A few drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter spells in the east. Windy,
OL,9,Fwith coastal gales in far northwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FFrequent and occasionally
OL,12,Fheavy showers in the evening, becoming
OL,13,Flighter and more isolated overnight.
OL,14,FStrong westerly winds in the evening
OL,15,Fwill start to ease overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FBright with sunny spells and
OL,18,Foccasional showers, the best of the
OL,19,Fdry weather towards Inverness and
OL,20,FNairn. Breezy to start but winds
OL,21,Fbecoming light through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
